# shell: desktop
# CW-065/PVS-019/PVK-007: the multi-window shell draws an icon mode at all,
# a click lands on the ART rather than anywhere in its cell, and an arrow
# key moves geometrically rather than along the sort order.
note Cmd+1 switches this window to icon mode
key 1 ctrl
wait 10
note clicking an icon selects that one thing
click 88 119
wait 3
expect-selected 1
expect-selected-name sub
note the space BETWEEN two icons is nobody's: it clears the selection,
note which is what makes a band sweepable between them
click 150 119
wait 3
expect-selected 0
note Right moves to the icon beside it, not to the next name in the list
click 88 119
wait 3
key Right
wait 3
expect-selected 1
expect-selected-name a.txt
note Left comes back, and Down from the only row goes nowhere rather than
note wrapping to the far side of the window
key Left
wait 3
expect-selected-name sub
key Down
wait 3
expect-selected-name sub
quit
